# BDD features 文件模板（feature.template）
# S-bdd 子代理产出 .feature 文件时套用本模板：复制本文件到 features/L<level>/L<level>_<system>-<num>.feature
# 将所有 <...> 占位符替换为真实值；删除说明性注释（以 `# ` 开头且非 `# @` 头标注的行）
# 权威设计：docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-bdd-modeling-and-acceptance-fixture-design.md
# 可执行细则：references/bdd-guide.md §2-§3
#
# 文件命名规则：L<level>_<system>[_<subsystem>][_<atom>]-<feature-num>.feature
#   L1 示例：L1_blog_system-001.feature
#   L2 示例：L2_blog_system_auth-001.feature
#   L3 示例：L3_blog_system_article_store-001.feature
#   L4 示例：L4_blog_system_token_store_issue-001.feature
#
# 头标注 9 个字段全部必填（见 bdd-guide.md §2.2）；L1 @parent-features 填 (none)；L4 @child-features 填 (none)
# Background 节七要素全部必填（见 bdd-guide.md §3.2）；值可空集时填 ()
# scenario TAG 含 @REQ-NNN / @<UAT|ST|IT|UT>-NNN / @BDD-L<level>-<num> / @high|medium|low
# BDD L4 ↔ TLA+ L3 最细粒度（原子方法级），@tla-spec 填同层 TLA+ L3 spec ID

# @req: <REQ-NNN>
# @design: <SD-X.Y.Z>
# @system: <L>_<system_name>
# @tla-spec: <L>_<system_name>
# @state-machine: SM-<L>_<system_name>
# @parent-features: <parent-feature-id> | (none)
# @sibling-features: <sibling-feature-id> | (none)
# @child-features: <child-feature-id> | (none)
# @scenario-id-prefix: BDD-<L>
Feature: <feature name>
  <作为...>
  <我希望...>
  <以便...>

Background:
  # @states: <State1>, <State2>
  # @initial-state: <State1>
  # @terminal-states: <State2> | ()
  # @accepting-states: <State2>
  # @rejecting-states: <State1> | ()
  # @transitions:
  #   <State1> + <event1> -> <State2> [guard: <condition>] [action: <sideEffect>]
  # @invariants:
  #   <State2> => <condition>
  Given 系统处于初始状态

@REQ-NNN @UAT-NNN @BDD-L-001 @high
Scenario: <scenario name>
  Given 系统处于 "<State1>" 状态
  When 用户执行 <event1>
  Then 系统应转移到 "<State2>" 状态
  And 不变式 "<State2> => <condition>" 应成立
